"char_end": 5105,
"unit_id": "t0038.u01",
"sent_id": "t0038.s01"
},
{
"start": 235.45,
"end": 240.0,
"speaker_label": "SPEAKER_00",
"text": "What is the opposing viewpoint that most listeners don't have access to?",
"char_start": 5106,
"char_end": 5178,
"unit_id": "t0038.u01",
"sent_id": "t0038.s02"
},
{
"start": 240.0,
"end": 242.41,
"speaker_label": "SPEAKER_01",
"text": "It boils down to this: drainage is the design decision that has the biggest impact on any trail.",
"char_start": 5191,
"char_end": 5287,
"unit_id": "t0039.u01",
"sent_id": "t0039.s01"
},
{
"start": 242.41,
"end": 243.82,
"speaker_label": "SPEAKER_01",
"text": "We've seen it happen with teams using RockShox products.",
"char_start": 5288,
"char_end": 5344,
"unit_id": "t0039.u01",
"sent_id": "t0039.s02"
},
{
"start": 243.82,
"end": 246.0,
"speaker_label": "SPEAKER_01",
"text": "If you ignore it, you'll end up having to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
"char_start": 5345,
"char_end": 5432,
"unit_id": "t0039.u01",
"sent_id": "t0039.s03"
},
{
"start": 246.0,
"end": 248.9,
"speaker_label": "SPEAKER_00",
"text": "What is the typical process for dealing with a malfunction?",
"char_start": 5445,
"char_end": 5504,
"unit_id": "t0040.u01",
"sent_id": "t0040.s01"
},
{
"start": 248.9,
"end": 252.0,
"speaker_label": "SPEAKER_00",
"text": "What is the most often overlooked aspect of trail construction?",
"char_start": 5505,
"char_end": 5568,
"unit_id": "t0040.u01",
"sent_id": "t0040.s02"
},
{
"start": 252.0,
"end": 255.26,
"speaker_label": "SPEAKER_01",
"text": "Honestly, the most common mistake that novice builders make is digging with a slope that is too steep.",
"char_start": 5581,
"char_end": 5683,
"unit_id": "t0041.u01",
"sent_id": "t0041.s01"
},
{
"start": 255.26,
"end": 258.0,
"speaker_label": "SPEAKER_01",
"text": "The overall picture is important because it tells you what compromises you are making.",
"char_start": 5684,
"char_end": 5770,
"unit_id": "t0041.u01",
"sent_id": "t0041.s02"
},
{
"start": 258.0,
"end": 264.0,
"speaker_label": "SPEAKER_00",
"text": "Before we wrap up, what's one thing listeners can try out this week?",
"char_start": 5783,
"char_end": 5851,
"unit_id": "t0042.u01",
"sent_id": "t0042.s01"
},
{
"start": 264.0,
"end": 268.21,
"speaker_label": "SPEAKER_01",
"text": "Choose one of the ideas we discussed and implement it for two weeks.",
"char_start": 5864,
"char_end": 5932,
"unit_id": "t0043.u01",
"sent_id": "t0043.s01"
},
{
"start": 268.21,
"end": 270.0,
"speaker_label": "SPEAKER_01",
"text": "Everything else is iteration.",
"char_start": 5933,
"char_end": 5962,
"unit_id": "t0043.u01",
"sent_id": "t0043.s02"
},
{
"start": 270.0,
"end": 272.1,
"speaker_label": "SPEAKER_00",
"text": "And finally, a big thank you to our partners at Linear.",
"char_start": 5975,
"char_end": 6030,
"unit_id": "t0044.u01",
"sent_id": "t0044.s01"
},
{
"start": 272.1,
"end": 274.97,
"speaker_label": "SPEAKER_00",
"text": "Linear is the ticketing system designed for speed \u2013 built for the keyboard.",
"char_start": 6031,
"char_end": 6106,
"unit_id": "t0044.u01",
"sent_id": "t0044.s02"
},
{
"start": 274.97,
"end": 276.0,
"speaker_label": "SPEAKER_00",
"text": "Check it out at linear.com.",
"char_start": 6107,
"char_end": 6134,
"unit_id": "t0044.u01",
"sent_id": "t0044.s03"
},
{
"start": 276.0,
